  "footer": "The After pictures are Camps’ real Compare dialog in the preview with the shared part’s own markup swapped in (read from <code>components/CompareDialog.jsx</code>: <code>.cmp-diff</code> with the 12px ti-alert-triangle, <code>.cmp-dialog</code> + <code>is-unavailable</code>, and <code>.dialog-footer</code> around the buttons and note on PC / tablet), so the app’s real <code>shared.css</code> draws them. On phones the shared part keeps today’s order (button, then note), as the short-phone shot shows. “Today, while it works” and both “Saving failed” shots are real, made with the preview’s slowed-down and failing saves. Hide private details keeps C1’s gray “Hidden on this tablet” rows (already built). <b>Script:</b> <code>mock-c20-compare.js</code>.",
